msgstr ""
"Plan purchases stop granting or revoking access while the switch is off, but stored "
"grants are preserved and everything resumes when you switch it back on. Secure file "
"delivery keeps running; WooCommerce per-release purchases are never affected by this "
"switch."

msgid "ووکامرس فعال نیست. برای مدیریت محصولات طرح VIP آن را فعال کنید. پس از فعال‌شدن ووکامرس، شناسه‌های محصول در دسترس خواهند بود."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce is not active. Activate it to manage VIP plan products. Product IDs will "
"be available once WooCommerce is enabled."

msgid "ویرایش"
msgstr "Edit"

